title: "The Metriplectic Tether Model on T^3: The Energy-Generated Tether Correction Vanishes Identically, and Global Regularity of the Model Is Equivalent to Periodic Navier–Stokes Global Regularity (Lean 4 formalization and paper)"
type: software
